  "description": "Seo Eun-woo, a college student who's lived the life of a nerd accustomed to eating in the bathroom. One day, Lee Yeon-joo, the campus's most beautiful goddess, starts flirting with him...?\n\n*\"Well, let's meet up. Then we'll definitely figure something out.\"*\n\nThe love story of a nerd and an enigmatic campus goddess. But...is love really this difficult and challenging?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
